      "title": "Invoice number collision under concurrent checkout",
      "state": "your_turn",
      "prompt": null,
      "lastPrompt": "Find out why the invoicer hands out duplicate invoice numbers when two checkouts land in the same second.",
      "lastPromptAt": 1792164540000,
      "lastReply": "Found it. `NextNumber` reads the sequence row without a lock, so two transactions can both read 41022 before either writes.\n\nFix: wrap the read/increment in `with_lock` (SELECT … FOR UPDATE). I added a regression spec that spins two threads against the same prefix; it fails on main and passes with the lock.\n\nWant me to open a PR?",
      "lastReplyAt": 1792166160000,
